§ `Tests -- 9 to 17 members: the 8-member total plus the per-additional-person figure for each member above 8 (page line 69)`

-- 48 States: $225 per additional person: 9 members = 1841 + 1*225 = 2066; 17 members = 1841 + 9*225 = 3866
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 9 `the 48 contiguous States and the District of Columbia` EQUALS JUST 2066
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 17 `the 48 contiguous States and the District of Columbia` EQUALS JUST 3866
-- Hawaii: $364: 10 members = 2979 + 2*364 = 3707
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 10 Hawaii EQUALS JUST 3707
-- Alaska urban $287: 12 members = 2352 + 4*287 = 3500; rural 1 $366: 9 = 2999 + 366 = 3365; rural 2 $446: 9 = 3650 + 446 = 4096
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 12 `Alaska, urban` EQUALS JUST 3500
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 9 `Alaska, rural 1` EQUALS JUST 3365
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 9 `Alaska, rural 2` EQUALS JUST 4096
-- Guam $331: 9 = 2714 + 331 = 3045; Virgin Islands $289: 11 = 2367 + 3*289 = 3234
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 9 Guam EQUALS JUST 3045
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 11 `the Virgin Islands of the United States` EQUALS JUST 3234

§ `Tests -- 18 or more members: the cap, a total (page line 70)`

-- 48 States $3,887; Alaska urban $4,965; rural 1 $6,331; rural 2 $7,705; Guam $5,729; Hawaii $6,289; Virgin Islands $4,997
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 18 `the 48 contiguous States and the District of Columbia` EQUALS JUST 3887
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 18 `Alaska, urban` EQUALS JUST 4965
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 18 `Alaska, rural 1` EQUALS JUST 6331
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 18 `Alaska, rural 2` EQUALS JUST 7705
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 18 Guam EQUALS JUST 5729
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 18 Hawaii EQUALS JUST 6289
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 18 `the Virgin Islands of the United States` EQUALS JUST 4997
-- the cap does not grow: 25 members is still $3,887 in the 48 States
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 25 `the 48 contiguous States and the District of Columbia` EQUALS JUST 3887
-- the 17/18 boundary, from the page's own arithmetic: 17 members = 3866, 18 members = 3887 (the cap is above the 17-member figure)
#ASSERT `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 18 `the 48 contiguous States and the District of Columbia` GREATER THAN `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` 17 `the 48 contiguous States and the District of Columbia`

